      answer: 57,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f492ee905d3d6a8a2a0f12&questionId=6a0722fd33041bf9737cf7f4&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f492ee905d3d6a8a2a0f12&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a0722fd33041bf9737cf7f4&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F6190c8f3-da27-4406-804b-565a64e687cc%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a0722fd33041bf9737cf7f5&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:26)</a></p>
<p>compute(val) returns val + 5<br />calculate(val) returns (val*3) + 5<br />For index = 2 &rarr; compute(calculate(2)) = compute(11) = 16<br />For index = 3 &rarr; compute(calculate(3)) = compute(14) = 19<br />For index = 4 &rarr; compute(calculate(4)) = compute(17) = 22Total = 16 + 19 + 22 = 57<br />Hence, the output is 57.</p>`
