      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">Consider the given set of elements: {78, 29, 46, 90, 27, 15, 140, 56, 16, 35}.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">An array is created out of it such that 46 is the last element of the array.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Quicksort partition algorithm is used by choosing the last element as pivot, then what are the total number of&nbsp; arrangements of this array is possible to preserve the effect of first pass of partition algorithm?</p>`,
