      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>35</p>`,
        `<p>39</p>`,
        `<p>5</p>`,
        `<p>34</p>`,
      ],
      answer: ["B", "D"],
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4a48ae5b979df24335511&questionId=6a14015249b658852b4ac8bc&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4a48ae5b979df24335511&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a14015249b658852b4ac8bc&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F51e5914d-4d30-4beb-a1a3-2a271dae1db2%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a14015249b658852b4ac8bd&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:12:26)</a></p>
<p>Uniform Binary Encoding</p>
<p>no of bits required for a character = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="&#8968;" close="&#8969;"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> (n is number of character Present in the language)</p>
<p>n = 6</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="&#8968;" close="&#8969;"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>bits</mi></math></p>
<p>Total char in the given String = 13</p>
<p>each char = 3 bits</p>
<p>Total bits = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>bits</mi></math></p>
<p><strong>Huffman Tree:</strong></p>
<p><img title="graph (1).png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/d1126d30-7a04-44d9-afd9-fa70d19c56bd.png" alt="" width="414" height="312" /></p>
<p><strong>Huffman Encoding</strong></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>22</mn></math></p>
<p>0.17 ,0.26, 0.39, 0.61</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Text: </strong>BAACDFDEAFCBD</p>
<p>Frequency:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p>No of bits required</p>
<p>A=101=3bits</p>
<p>B=001= 3bits</p>
<p>C=100= 3bits</p>
<p>D=11= 2bits</p>
<p>E=000=3bits</p>
<p>F=01=2bits</p>
<p>Total bits <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>9</mn><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>4</mn></math></p>
<p>= 34 bits</p>`
