      text: `<p>Let A be a <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math> real symmetric matrix with eigen values 1, 2 and 3. What is determinant of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8211;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext></math>?_______</p>`,
