      answer: 0,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4a676e5b979df24335d29&questionId=6a26ba37cb63bfb96e5a000f&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4a676e5b979df24335d29&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a26ba37cb63bfb96e5a000f&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F7fcf68c6-7a23-428b-beda-abbc956812ba%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a26ba37cb63bfb96e5a0010&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:24)</a></p>
<p data-start="61" data-end="251">Eigenvalues are 1, 2, 3. The characteristic polynomial is:<br data-start="149" data-end="152" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></span></span></p>
<p data-start="253" data-end="384">By the <strong data-start="260" data-end="287">Cayley-Hamilton Theorem</strong>, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> satisfies:<br data-start="307" data-end="310" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></span><br data-start="341" data-end="344" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi></math></span></span></p>
<p data-start="386" data-end="606"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi></math></span></span><br data-start="454" data-end="457" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi></math></span></span><br data-start="514" data-end="517" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math></span></span><br data-start="544" data-end="547" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math></span></span><br data-start="578" data-end="581" data-is-only-node="" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math></span></span></p>
<p data-start="608" data-end="723"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math></span></span><br data-start="671" data-end="674" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math></span></span></p>
<p data-start="725" data-end="908">Eigenvalues of <span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="mord mathnormal"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></span></span></span></span><br data-start="761" data-end="764" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="mop"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></span></span></span><br data-start="830" data-end="833" /><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></span></span></p>`
