<p data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><span class="math-inline" data-math="E[X] = \\int_{0}^{2} x f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{2} x \\cdot \\frac{3}{8} x^{2} dx = \\frac{3}{8} \\left[ \\frac{x^{4}}{4} \\right]_{0}^{2} = \\frac{3}{2} = 1.5" data-index-in-node="0">2. <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&int;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&int;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>&sdot;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced open="[" close="]"><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></math></span></p>
