<p data-path-to-node="1,3,0"><span class="math-inline" data-math="Var(X) = E[X^{2}] - [E(X)]^{2} = 2.4 - (1.5)^{2} = 2.4 - 2.25 = 0.15" data-index-in-node="0">4. <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>Var</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>[</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>&minus;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>&minus;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>2.25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.15</mn></math></span></p>
