      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">A printer P1 can print 100 pages twice as fast as printer P2. Printer P2 prints 100 pages in 40 minutes. If both printers work at a constant speed, how many pages can printer P1 print in 6 minutes?</p>`,
      image: "",
