      answer: "D",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4a7870897516718e821a1&questionId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b894c&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4a7870897516718e821a1&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b894c&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F7a23b1b2-8505-49ad-b41e-24db479afeee%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b894d&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:54)</a></p>
<p>P2 prints 100 pages in 40 min<br />&rArr; Speed of P2 = 2.5 pages/min</p>
<p>P1 is twice as fast<br />&rArr; Speed of P1 = 5 pages/min</p>
<p>In 6 minutes:<br />Pages by P1 = 5 &times; 6 = 30 pages</p>
<p>Answer: 30 pages</p>`
