      text: `<p>A cyclist rides from one town to another with the help of a tailwind and takes 4 hours. Riding back against the wind takes 5 hours for the same distance. If the speed of the wind is 2 km/h, what is the cyclist&rsquo;s speed in still air?&nbsp;</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>20 km/h</p>`,
        `<p>19 km/h</p>`,
        `<p>18 km/h</p>`,
        `<p>19.5 km/h</p>`,
      ],
      answer: "C",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4a7870897516718e821a1&questionId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b8952&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4a7870897516718e821a1&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b8952&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F2843a6c7-2a50-42e5-9081-29f8615eade4%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b8953&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:03:17)</a></p>
<p>Cyclist speed = x km/h</p>
<p>Down stream &rarr; 4 hours</p>
<p>Upstream &rarr; 5 hours</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>
<p>D = 4(x + 2) = 4x + 8</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>
<p>D = 5 (x &ndash; 2)</p>
<p>D = 5x &ndash; 10</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> 4x + 8 = 5x &ndash; 10</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> x = 18 km/h</p>`
