      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">A company produces two types of eco-friendly fuel blends for vehicles. The first blend contains 25% ethanol mixed with petrol, while the second blend contains 30% ethanol. To prepare a new fuel mixture for testing, an engineer pours 6 parts of the first blend and 4 parts of the second blend into a storage tank. What percentage of ethanol is present in the final fuel mixture?</p>`,
