      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">An artist creates a giant decorative cube-shaped sculpture with side length 4 meters for an exhibition. To make the sculpture visually attractive, she paints two opposite faces red, another pair of opposite faces blue, one of the remaining faces green, and the final face yellow. Later, the sculpture is carefully cut into 64 smaller cubes of equal size so they can be distributed as souvenirs to visitors. Some of these small cubes have paint on one face, some on two faces, and some on three faces depending on their position in the original sculpture. How many of the small cubes will have exactly two colours, i.e. green and blue, painted on their surfaces?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>12</p>`,
        `<p>4</p>`,
        `<p>6</p>`,
        `<p>14</p>`,
      ],
      answer: "B",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4a7870897516718e821a1&questionId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b8960&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4a7870897516718e821a1&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b8960&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F5d66c650-8507-4865-8b65-8b9217462124%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a2f8bb008c08224ad7b8961&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:03:25)</a></p>
<p>Green and blue meet along 2 edges of the cube.<br />Each edge has (4 &minus; 2) = 2 small cubes with exactly two painted faces.</p>
<p>Total = 2 &times; 2 = 4</p>`
