      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">Five friends, Aman, Namita, Anupam, Vineeta, and Peyush, are standing in a row for a photograph. There are two person between Namita and Peyush. Anupam does not stand immediately next to Namita. There is exactly one person between Anupam and Aman, with Anupam standing somewhere to the right of Aman. Anupam is also not standing immediately next to Vineeta. Which of the following statements is correct with respect to the information above?</p>`,
