      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">In an ancient kingdom, a secret treasure lock could only be opened using a 5-letter magical chant made from the symbols a, b, c, x, p, q, and r. The royal wizard explained that the chant would work only if it sounded exactly the same when spoken from left to right and from right to left. How many different magical chants (five letter palindrome) are possible?</p>`,
