<p>Candidate key is&nbsp;<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Programmer-ID</span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Programming-Package-ID</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>
