      answer: "A",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4aa590897516718e82675&questionId=6a434c3345326d613d9a4538&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4aa590897516718e82675&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a434c3345326d613d9a4538&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F39b152d5-a46b-477e-86bf-4d2bddfeae4d%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a434c3345326d613d9a4539&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:03:46)</a></p>
<p>DNS is used to resolve domain names to IP addresses, so <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.<br />SMTP is used for sending emails, so <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">Q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.<br />HTTP is used for transferring web pages, so <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />FTP is used for transferring files, so <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence the correct matching is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>and the correct answer is (A).</p>`
