      text: `<p>The following postfix expression is evaluated using the stack: &nbsp;<br />6 2 3 + - 3 8 2 / + * 2 &uarr; 3 +<br />Consider that <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&uarr;</mo></math> is the exponential operation and has the priority less than <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>*</mo><mo>.</mo></math> What is the final value after evaluation_____________&nbsp; ?</p>`,
