      answer: 52,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4aace1ab83565959a6430&questionId=6a473a3fe60a9d235dfe4b49&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4aace1ab83565959a6430&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a473a3fe60a9d235dfe4b49&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Ff8ee0abf-0527-4394-9421-0bb1a2078c23%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a473a3fe60a9d235dfe4b4a&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:00)</a></p>
<p>6 2 3 + - 3 8 2 / + * 2 &uarr; 3 +</p>
<p>= 6 5 - 3 8 2 / + * 2 &uarr; 3 +</p>
<p>= 1 3 8 2 / + * 2 &uarr; 3 +</p>
<p>= 1 3 4 + * 2 &uarr; 3 +</p>
<p>= 1 7 * 2 &uarr; 3 +</p>
<p>= 7 2 &uarr; 3 +</p>
<p>= 49 3 +</p>
<p>= 52</p>`
