      answer: ["A", "B", "C"],
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4ab416fcaa08f535c2726&questionId=6a4bcee16d8783e195a80ad9&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4ab416fcaa08f535c2726&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a4bcee16d8783e195a80ad9&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F7fe87c38-78cf-45ff-8e51-103439809837%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a4bcee16d8783e195a80ada&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:03:20)</a></p>
<p>The cost of insert in AVL tree depends upon the height which is logn.hence true.</p>
<p>Binary tree worst case height linear hence O(n). hence true.</p>
<p>BST in worst case can be linear hence insertion O(n) , Balanced BST height logn hence TRUE.</p>
<p>AVL tree deletion is &Theta;(log n), not &Theta;(n). hence,Option D is false.</p>`
