      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4ac36986809213f5c1422&questionId=6a4f7ea49bd8cd177b354228&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4ac36986809213f5c1422&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a4f7ea49bd8cd177b354228&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F43441aa8-4ad9-4006-9ff2-999ffd28e3df%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a4f7ea49bd8cd177b354229&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:45)</a></p>
<p>Calculating need = Max &ndash; Allocation</p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 34.9499%; height: 156.722px;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 44.7778px;">
<td style="width: 50.0927%; text-align: center; height: 44.7778px;"><strong>Process</strong></td>
<td style="width: 49.8447%; text-align: center; height: 44.7778px;"><strong>Need</strong><br /><strong>R1 &nbsp;R2 &nbsp;R3 &nbsp;R4</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22.3889px;">
<td style="width: 50.0927%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">P1</td>
<td style="width: 49.8447%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22.3889px;">
<td style="width: 50.0927%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">P2</td>
<td style="width: 49.8447%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22.3889px;">
<td style="width: 50.0927%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">P3</td>
<td style="width: 49.8447%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22.3889px;">
<td style="width: 50.0927%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">P4</td>
<td style="width: 49.8447%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 22.3889px;">
<td style="width: 50.0927%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">P5</td>
<td style="width: 49.8447%; text-align: center; height: 22.3889px;">4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Initially only process P1 or P2 can be completed. After completion of P1</p>
<p>Available = Available + Allocation</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; =<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>
<p>Still processes P3, P4 and P5 cannot be completed as all need 4 instances of R1. And available are only 3. So only P2 can be completed next, After completion of P1</p>
<p>Available = Available + Allocation</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>
<p>Now need to all remaining processes is lesser than this available. Hence any of three remaining processes(P3,P4,P5) can be completed in any order. All processes will be completed hence system is safe.</p>
<p>Number of safe sequences = {any of P1 or P2 in any order} &times; {any of P3, P4 and P5 in any order}</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; =<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = 12</p>`
