<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&macr;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&macr;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>&macr;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>ABC</mi><mo>&macr;</mo></mover><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> will be '0' only</p>
