<p>Only 1 NAND gate as&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&macr;</mo></mover><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&macr;</mo></mover></math> are available&nbsp;</p>
