      text: `<p>Consider the following implementation of queue using a stack S1 and S2<br />void enqueu(Q,x)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Push (S1,x);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;}<br />void dequeue(Q, x) <br />&nbsp; {<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; if (stack-empty(S1)) then<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;print("Q is empty");<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;return;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; else<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;while (! stack-empty(S1)) <br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x=pop(S1);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; push(S2, x);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x=pop(S2);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; while (! stack-empty(S2))<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x=pop(S2);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; push(S1, x);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }<br />&nbsp;}<br />If we perform 100 enqueue operation and 1 dequeue operation then which of the following is<br />FALSE for the operation performed ?<br /><br /></p>`,
