      text: `<p>The following takes a linked list head pointer and length of the linked list as parameter<br />typedef struct node<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;int data;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;struct node * link;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;} node;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;void foo (node* start, int n )<br />{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;int i, j, k, temp ;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;struct node *p, *q ;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;p = start ;<br />&nbsp;for ( i = 0 ; i &lt; n - 1 ; i++ )<br />&nbsp; {<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;q = p -&gt; link ;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;for ( j = i + 1 ; j &lt; n ; j++ )<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; {<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if ( p -&gt; data &gt; q -&gt; data )<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;temp = p -&gt; data ; p -&gt; data = q -&gt; data ; q -&gt; data = temp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; q = q -&gt; link;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; p = p -&gt; link ;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;}<br />}<br />Which of the following is TRUE for Above function?</p>`,
