      text: `<p>Consider the following program<br />#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<br />int fun(int x)<br />{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;static int s = 3;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;s = s + x;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;return s % 5;<br />}<br />int main() <br />{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;int check = 4;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;char ch = '0';<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;switch (-16 % 2 + 4 + fun(check))<br />{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;case 2 * 13 / 4 + -8 % 3:<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ch += fun(1);<br />case ('b' || 2):<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;ch += 2;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;break;<br />default:<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;ch -= fun(2);<br />}<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;printf("%d", ch);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;return 0;<br />}<br />Out put of the program is?</p>`,
