      text: `<p>Consider the following program<br />#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; int main ()<br />{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; int x = 4, y;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; int *p = &amp;x;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; int **q = &amp;p;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; y = ++(*p) + 30;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; y = y + ++(**q);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; y = 2 * (*p++ + 3);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; printf("%d", y);<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; return 0;<br />}<br />What is the output of the program?</p>`,
