      text: `<p>The chromatic index of the complete graph&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">K</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi></msub></math> is:</p>`,
