      text: `<p>Let G be a simple graph with maximum degree <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">&#916;</mi></math>. According to Vizing's Theorem, the chromatic index&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">&#967;</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">G</mi><mo>)</mo></math> satisfies:</p>`,
