<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>&#172;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>&#172;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Q</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p>
