<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#172;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Q</mi></math></p>
