      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 4,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4b1d4107980e9daa97f71&questionId=6a70979f122c6574acfa4db0&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4b1d4107980e9daa97f71&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a70979f122c6574acfa4db0&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F42f00e26-2cf8-4863-8d9f-3cda2e59707d%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a70979f122c6574acfa4db1&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:01:14)</a></p>
<p>A connected graph with <span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span> vertices is a tree <strong data-start="394" data-end="412">if and only if</strong> it has exactly <span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mbin">&minus;</span></span><span class="base"><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> edges.</p>
<p data-start="764" data-end="838">Hence, all four statements are equivalent characterizations of a tree.</p>`
