      text: `<p>A byte-addressable main memory system is connected to a CPU. The CPU word size of 64 bits. The total memory capacity of 512 MBytes. The memory is constructed using SRAM chips of size 16M&times;4 bits. The minimum number of SRAM chips required to implement the complete memory system is _______.</p>`,
      image: "",
