      text: `<p>The function&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> has a stationary point at <span class="math-inline" data-math="x = x_0" data-index-in-node="58"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></span>. The value of <span class="math-inline" data-math="f''(x_0)" data-index-in-node="80"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math></span>&nbsp;is _______.</p>`,
