      video: "https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&questionId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398f6&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398f6&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Ffea72400-9ba1-44b9-9e55-daa950783cb5%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398f7&back_button=false",
      text: `<p>Let <span class="math-inline" data-math="J" data-index-in-node="4">J</span> be an <span class="math-inline" data-math="n \\times n" data-index-in-node="12">n &times; n</span> matrix where every entry is <span class="math-inline" data-math="1" data-index-in-node="51">1</span>. Let <span class="math-inline" data-math="A = J - 2I" data-index-in-node="58">A = J - 2I</span>, where <span class="math-inline" data-math="I" data-index-in-node="76">I</span> is the identity matrix. If <span class="math-inline" data-math="n = 10" data-index-in-node="105">n = 10</span>, which of the following is/are the eigenvalues of <span class="math-inline" data-math="A" data-index-in-node="162">A</span>?</p>`,
      image: "",
