      text: `<p>Let A be a <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>matrix with rank 3 and trace 10. If&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is an eigen value with algebraic multiplicity 2, what is the sum of the other three eigen values _____?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        ``,
        ``,
        ``,
        ``,
      ],
      answer: 10,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&questionId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398e7&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398e7&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F5607631b-371f-42b1-b401-e58985618dcf%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398e8&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:01:16)</a></p>
<p>As we know, sum of all eigen values is equal to trace of matrix.</p>
<p>Sum of eigen values = 10</p>
<p>Given that the two eigen values are 0.</p>
<p>So, sum of remaining three <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>`
