      video: "https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&questionId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398ea&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398ea&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F942f80e5-8c37-48dc-b5d0-c598aec77d4a%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398eb&back_button=false",
      text: `<p>Let A be a&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn></math> matrix with rank 3. What is the minimum possible rank of any <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>submatrix of A ________ ?</p>`,
