      answer: 1,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&questionId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398ea&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f495c08180c1555ca923d2&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398ea&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F942f80e5-8c37-48dc-b5d0-c598aec77d4a%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a7aba52dbe819551c9398eb&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:01:55)</a></p>
<p>Deleting one row and one column can reduce the rank by at most 2.</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi>rank</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>rank</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
<p>correct answer = 1</p>`
