      answer: "A",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4e4c3502ee71a214bad98&questionId=6a7ec1ff351f0c39c71afb6a&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4e4c3502ee71a214bad98&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a7ec1ff351f0c39c71afb6a&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F63881c4d-50f2-4e3a-9e58-cd2cdec7c861%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a7ec1ff351f0c39c71afb6b&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:44)</a></p>
<p>Assume all are facing the center, so right means anticlockwise.</p>
<p>Place Charlie at any position.</p>
<p>Harry is immediately to the right of Charlie.<br />Lisa is second to the right of Harry.<br />Milan is immediately to the right of Francis.<br />Milan is third to the left of Daniel.</p>
<p>After placing the people according to these conditions, the only valid circular arrangement is:</p>
<p>Charlie &rarr; Milan &rarr; Francis &rarr; Kiran &rarr; Lisa &rarr; Daniel &rarr; Harry (clockwise)</p>
<p>Now, count second to the right of Charlie:</p>
<p>First to the right: Harry<br />Second to the right: Daniel</p>
<p>Answer: Daniel</p>`
