      text: `<p>A directional puzzle involves Arvind and Bhaskar whose offices are 5 km apart, with Arvind&rsquo;s office to the south of Bhaskar&rsquo;s. Bhaskar moves 2 km toward Arvind, then turns left and travels 3 km, followed by a right turn for another 3 km. In which direction is Arvind&rsquo;s office from his current position?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>West</p>`,
        `<p>South</p>`,
        `<p>East</p>`,
        `<p>North</p>`,
      ],
      answer: "A",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4e4c3502ee71a214bad98&questionId=6a7ec200351f0c39c71afbc0&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4e4c3502ee71a214bad98&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a7ec200351f0c39c71afbc0&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Fd1d1ffa6-f353-4f7c-85ac-c4a888b1c096%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a7ec200351f0c39c71afbc1&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:03:14)</a></p>
<p>Let Bhaskar's office be at (0, 0).</p>
<p>Since Arvind's office is 5 km south of Bhaskar's, Arvind's office is at (0, -5).</p>
<p>Bhaskar moves 2 km towards Arvind (south), reaching (0, -2).</p>
<p>He then turns left (towards the east) and moves 3 km, reaching (3, -2).</p>
<p>He then turns right (towards the south) and moves 3 km, reaching (3, -5).</p>
<p>Arvind's office is at (0, -5).</p>
<p>From Bhaskar's current position (3, -5), Arvind's office is 3 km to the west.</p>`
