      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4e5ea8180c1555cab2da8&questionId=6a842b5ca3d58651e9bea768&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4e5ea8180c1555cab2da8&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a842b5ca3d58651e9bea768&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F3128b6a8-30dc-4663-a894-069aebe495d4%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a842b5ca3d58651e9bea769&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:48)</a></p>
<p>In the worst case (descending order), during the <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi>th</mi></msup></math> iteration of Insertion Sort, the current element is swapped i -1 times.</p>
<p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p>=66</p>
<p>Therefore, the correct answer is 66.</p>`
