      text: `<p>Consider the following array of elements.</p>
<p>24, 31, 95, 42, 5, 89, 56, 13, 78, 67</p>
<p>Which one or more of the following arrays could have resulted after exactly one partitioning step of the Quick Sort algorithm, assuming the pivot is placed in its final sorted position?</p>`,
