      options: [
      ],
      answer: 13,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4e718502ee71a214baed6&questionId=6a8c247ea6032413702bad5a&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4e718502ee71a214baed6&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a8c247ea6032413702bad5a&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F4f98a76d-226a-4cf7-8cd5-f043b6c2222f%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a8c247ea6032413702bad5b&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:00:27)</a></p>
<p>For a multilevel index:</p>
<p>Each level requires 1 block access.<br />After reaching the last index level, one more access is needed to fetch the actual data record.</p>
<p>Given 12 index levels:</p>
<p>Block accesses=12+1=13</p>`
