      text: `<p>A 4-bit serial-in-serial out shift register is used with a clock frequency of 100 kHz. Then the time delay between the serial input and the Q<sub>3</sub> output is ________ <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>&#956;</mi></math>sec. (correct to nearest integer)</p>`,
