      text: `<p>A sequential circuit is as given below:</p>
<p><img title="1.png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/a8e45ae4-6983-48b4-8504-4ca8570ae065.png" alt="" width="401" height="140" /></p>
<p>Initial state of the above sequential circuit is Q<sub>C</sub>Q<sub>B</sub>Q<sub>A</sub> = (100)<sub>2</sub> then after 59 clock pulses the state of the sequential circuit will be __( )<sub>10</sub>__.</p>
<p>(correct to nearest integer)</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 3,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4eeff0897516718e866d3&questionId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fb0&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4eeff0897516718e866d3&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fb0&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Ff35188b6-e65c-4007-9cd2-2ef48a6cc879%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fb1&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:08:30)</a></p>
<p>Lets draw the circuit and analyze it:</p>
<p><img title="1.png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/9210df71-5c5c-417d-9270-87468408a5c2.png" alt="" width="438" height="153" /></p>
<ul>
<li>From the circuit, all the FFs are +ve edge triggered.</li>
<li>All FFs are operating in toggle mode of operation.</li>
<li>Q<sub>A</sub> toggles at every clock.</li>
<li>Q<sub>B </sub>toggles when&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub></math> takes transition from 0-1 or can say that Q<sub>A</sub> takes transition from 1-0.</li>
<li>Q<sub>C </sub>toggles when Q<sub>B </sub>takes transition from 0-1.</li>
<li>Lets generate all the states of sequential circuit:</li>
</ul>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 39.4582%; height: 33px;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">clk</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">Q<sub>C</sub></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">Q<sub>B</sub></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">Q<sub>A</sub></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">Starting State</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1<sup>st</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">2<sup>nd</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">3<sup>rd</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">4<sup>th</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">5<sup>th</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">6<sup>th</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">7<sup>th</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">8<sup>th</sup></td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
<td style="width: 25.0442%;">0</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Starting state after 8<sup>th</sup> clock and also eight different states are there so MOD no. = 8.</p>
<p>In question starting state is (100)<sub>2</sub> so</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>56</mn><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>57</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mover><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>101</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>58</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mover><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>010</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>59</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mover><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>011</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>
<p>So after 59<sup>th</sup> clk pulses output will be Q<sub>C</sub>Q<sub>B</sub>Q<sub>A</sub> = (011)<sub>2</sub> = (3)<sub>10</sub>.</p>`
