      answer: "D",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4eeff0897516718e866d3&questionId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fb6&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4eeff0897516718e866d3&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fb6&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Fa41732db-3349-4001-98b5-a6466768ad45%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fb7&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:57)</a></p>
<p>In the given circuit, Q<sub>2</sub> and Q<sub>0 </sub>can be considered as the output of D-FF.</p>
<p>Q<sub>3</sub> and Q<sub>1</sub> can be considered as the output of T-FF.</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mtable equalrows="true" equalcolumns="true"><mtr><mtd><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>C</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>B</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mtable equalrows="true" equalcolumns="true"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>
<p>So, after 2<sup>nd</sup> clock pulse, (Q<sub>3</sub>Q<sub>2</sub>Q<sub>1</sub>Q<sub>0</sub>) = (0101)<sub>2</sub> = (5)<sub>10</sub>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>`
