      answer: 1,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4eeff0897516718e866d3&questionId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fc2&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4eeff0897516718e866d3&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fc2&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F22fca8e8-a8ae-4e92-94d7-e602c893cf7a%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6a9b960e6fe403fd33618fc3&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:26)</a></p>
<p>We have,</p>
<p><img title="1.png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/cadb89ef-cd78-4594-ab51-358610b5cb78.png" alt="" width="313" height="126" /></p>
<p>From the above circuit, we get</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; and&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8857;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mtext>&#8201;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#8201;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p>Thus,&nbsp; <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8901;</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>T Flip-flop is always in Toggle mode.</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8853;</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><menclose notation="top"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></menclose></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Q always toggles whenever clock triggers.</p>
<p>Mode no. (M) = 2</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math></p>`
