<p>The grammar&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">G</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>aSa</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bSb</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&#949;</mi></math> (language is even length palindrome) is unambiguous but the language is not DCFL hence S1 is <strong>false</strong>.</p>
