      text: `<p>Consider the following productions:<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>aABe</mi></math>,<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Abc</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi></math>,<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></math><br />If the sentence "abbcde" is reduced to S, which of the following represent(s) a handle (using bottom-up parsing)?</p>`,
