      text: `<p>The integer value printed by the following ANSI-C program given below is?</p>
<p>&nbsp; #include&lt;studio.h&gt;</p>
<p>&nbsp; int bar(int y)<br />{</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; static int x = 12;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; x += y;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; return x;</p>
<p>&nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; int foo(int y)<br />{</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; static int x = 1;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; x += 10;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; return bar(x+y);</p>
<p>&nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; int main()<br />{</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; int x=10, y;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; y = foo(bar(x)) + x;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; printf("%d", (x+y));</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; return 0;</p>
<p>&nbsp; }</p>`,
