      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f15b1ab83565959d017c&questionId=6aae59134edeab974e8da1f3&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f15b1ab83565959d017c&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6aae59134edeab974e8da1f3&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F130295ca-8ce2-47df-92f6-1875f9119825%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6aae59134edeab974e8da1f4&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:04:06)</a></p>
<p>int x = 10, y<br />y = foo(bar(10)) + x<br />&nbsp; x = 12<br />&nbsp; x = x + y<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; 12 + 10 = 22<br />&nbsp; = foo(22) + 10<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x = 1<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x = 1 + 10 = 11<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; bar(33)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x = 22 + 33 = 55<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x = 55<br />In foo function 55 + 10 = 65<br />65 assigned to y<br />y =65<br />printf (x + y)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; = 10 + 65<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>= 75 Ans</strong></p>`
