      text: `<p>Consider the following program:</p>
<p>#include&lt;stdio.h&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p>int fun(int n) <br />{</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; static int sum = 7300;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; for(int i=0; i &lt; n; i++) {</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; for(int j=i; j &gt;= 5; j--) {</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; sum--;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; return sum;</p>
<p>&nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; int main() <br />{</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; printf("%d", fun(100)+fun(50));</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; return 0;</p>
<p>&nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; The output of the program is?</p>`,
