      text: `<p>Consider the system of linear equations.</p>
<div>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ky</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
</div>
<p>For which value of k does this system have a non‑zero solution? [integer value]&nbsp;</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 4,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f1d5107980e9daa9c142&questionId=6ab249fdeaa0977629d7c801&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f1d5107980e9daa9c142&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ab249fdeaa0977629d7c801&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Fcd8b1dac-37f5-431f-bd68-23c6fe41b3cb%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ab249fdeaa0977629d7c802&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:01:40)</a></p>
<p>So, For a homogeneous system to have a non‑zero solution:</p>
<div>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">&#8739;</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">&#8739;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
</div>
<p>where</p>
<div>
<div><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open="[" close="]"><mtable columnspacing="1em" rowspacing="0.16em" columnalign="center center center"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>6</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>4</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></div>
</div>
<p>Therefore,</p>
<div>
<div><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfenced open="|" close="|"><mtable columnspacing="1em" rowspacing="0.16em" columnalign="center center center"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mi>k</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>6</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mn>4</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></div>
</div>
<p>Expanding,</p>
<div>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><menclose notation="box"><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mstyle></menclose></math></p>
</div>`
