      text: `<p>A cylinder is inscribed in a sphere of radius R = 6. The height of cylinder for which its volume is maximum is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>, the value of R is ______. (nearest Integer value)</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 4,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f1d5107980e9daa9c142&questionId=6ab249feeaa0977629d7c816&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f1d5107980e9daa9c142&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ab249feeaa0977629d7c816&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F181f390a-e35d-4335-ba19-a005f282b4e5%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ab249feeaa0977629d7c817&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:45)</a></p>
<p><img title="Gemini_Generated_Image_3n0ck03n0ck03n0c.png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/37c52534-0f97-4fe5-8548-595d6ac38858.png" alt="" width="186" height="163" /></p>
<p>For the cylinder,</p>
<div>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>
</div>
<p>Therefore,</p>
<div>
<div><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&minus;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></div>
</div>
<p>Volume:</p>
<div>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">V</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&pi;r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&pi;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&minus;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&pi;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mo>&minus;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfrac><mi>dV</mi><mi>dh</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">&pi;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&minus;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>
</div>
<p>For maximum volume,</p>
<div>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfrac><mi>dV</mi><mi>dh</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&rArr;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&minus;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi></math></p>
<p>For R = 6:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&times;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mspace linebreak="newline"></mspace><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>
</div>`
