      text: `<p>Does <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">U</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi></msup><mi>cosy</mi></math> satisfy Laplace&rsquo;s equation?</p>
<div>
<div><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">u</mi><mi>xx</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">u</mi><mi>yy</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></div>
</div>`,
