      text: `<p>Let A be a <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn></math> matrix such that <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi></math>. If the rank of A is 3, what is the determinant of the matrix <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi></math>?</p>`,
