      text: `<p>A wholesaler purchases 26 kg of one variety of rice at ₹20 per kg and 30 kg of another variety of rice at ₹36 per kg. He mixes both varieties together and sells the entire mixture at a uniform rate of ₹30 per kg. What is the overall profit percentage earned by the wholesaler?</p>`,
