      text: `<p>Let X be uniformly distributed over (a, b) and <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>&le;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>&ge;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>|</mo></math>?</p>`,
