      answer: "D",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f1d5107980e9daa9c142&questionId=6ab249feeaa0977629d7c931&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f1d5107980e9daa9c142&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ab249feeaa0977629d7c931&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F95f6935e-11f6-453a-8632-e8188d0ce567%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ab249feeaa0977629d7c932&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:04:05)</a></p>
<p>X is uniformly distributed over [a, b], so the probability of an interval is proportional to its length.</p>
<p>The probability density function (pdf) is&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi></math></p>
<p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>
<p>For a uniform distribution,</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>length</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>from</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>to</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>length</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p>from (1) &amp; (2)</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>48</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mspace linebreak="newline"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mspace linebreak="newline"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>`
