      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">Consider a hypothetical processor in which memory is accessed using address register and data registers only. Further consider that the entire instruction is fetched in fetch cycle of instruction. All the branch type instructions use PC-relative mode for target calculation. In this processor, an unconditional branch instruction is to be executed next. Which of the following components can be involved in the execution cycle of this instruction?</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">1.&nbsp; Memory Address Register</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">2.&nbsp; Memory Data Register</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">3.&nbsp; Program Counter</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">4.&nbsp; Stack Pointer</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">5.&nbsp; Memory</p>`,
