      options: [
        `<p>Only 3</p>`,
        `<p>Only 3 &amp; 4</p>`,
        `<p>Only 1, 2, 4 &amp; 5</p>`,
        `<p>All 1, 2, 3, 4 &amp; 5</p>`,
      ],
      answer: "A",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f7903ac1a2e38d1834b7&questionId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c099&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f7903ac1a2e38d1834b7&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c099&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Ff816d273-b1e2-4b3e-81f0-4ec9a38d95dd%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c09a&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:55)</a></p>
<p>Given that we need to consider only the execution cycle, hence instruction fetch will not be considered.</p>
<p>In unconditional branch instruction PC (program counter<strong>)</strong> value should be updated by target address. Hence only program counter is only the register used.&nbsp;</p>`
