      video: "https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f7903ac1a2e38d1834b7&questionId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c10f&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f7903ac1a2e38d1834b7&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c10f&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F45b1bc80-dd05-4afd-a683-dc917ccaa9ca%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c110&back_button=false",
      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">Consider a 5 stages instruction pipeline. The condition is evaluated for a conditional branch instruction in <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math> stage, hence after condition is evaluated, the next instruction after the conditional branch instruction is fetched. The unconditional branch instruction is decoded in second stage itself hence the target instruction after the unconditional branch instruction is fetched after the <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math> stage of the instruction. Consider a program execution in which 10% instructions are branch type. Among all the branch instructions 40% are conditional branch instructions. If the pipeline stages delay are 7ns, 8ns, 5ns, 7ns and 5ns. Consider that there is no any cycle time overhead. The speed up of the pipeline (rounded to 2 decimal place) as compared to its corresponding non-pipeline system in ideal condition is ________?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 3.38,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4f7903ac1a2e38d1834b7&questionId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c10f&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4f7903ac1a2e38d1834b7&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c10f&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F45b1bc80-dd05-4afd-a683-dc917ccaa9ca%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6abfed72d13294cf8ca4c110&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:06:41)</a></p>
<p>1 instruction execution time in non-pipeline system = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math> ns</p>
<p>Pipeline cycle time = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>max</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ns</mi></math></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Stall due to conditional branch instruction = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>
<p>Stall due to unconditional branch instruction = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
<p>CPI = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;= 1.18</p>
<p>Speed up of the pipeline = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>*</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;= 3.3898</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = 3.39</p>`
