      text: `<p>Consider a disk with 100 cylinders (numbered 0 to 99) and having <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> number of requests pending for it. The system uses C-scan algorithm to service all the pending disk requests. The head can start from any cylinder of your choice and moving towards lower cylinder number during the service. The maximum number of times the head can change its direction during fulfilling all the pending requests, is _________?</p>
<p><strong>Note</strong> that there is no any direction change needed at starting position of the head.</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 2,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4fd7b8180c1555cab3854&questionId=6ac9b9be358b96dc996d63b3&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4fd7b8180c1555cab3854&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ac9b9be358b96dc996d63b3&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F0982fab5-9968-45d1-bf79-a42878405ad3%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ac9b9be358b96dc996d63b4&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:29)</a></p>
<p>Start the head from the middle and then service all the request till 0 in the order. Then at 0 the head reverses the direction and goes till 99. Now at 99 again the head direction changes and remaining disk requests will be serviced. Hence 2 times the head direction changes.</p>`
