      text: `<p>A computer system implements 4 kilobyte pages and a 33&minus;bit logical address space. Each page table entry contains some protection bits and the translation. If the maximum size of the page table of a process is 8 megabytes and the length of the physical address supported by the system is 38 bits then the number of protection bits per page table entry is _____bits?</p>`,
