      text: `<p>If the next date after 3<sup>rd</sup> Saturday in a month is 16<sup>th</sup>, what will be the date on a day before 5<sup>th</sup> Saturday?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>29</p>`,
        `<p>28</p>`,
        `<p>27</p>`,
        `<p>30</p>`,
      ],
      answer: "B",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&questionId=6ad2149e63f65db184295297&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ad2149e63f65db184295297&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F88fa0d94-6d82-42cb-9de9-f51304074190%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ad2149e63f65db184295298&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:01:58)</a></p>
<p>The 3rd Saturday is followed by the 16th, so the 3rd Saturday falls on the 15th.<br />Saturdays occur every 7 days, so the 5th Saturday falls on:<br />15 + 14 = 29.<br />The day before the 5th Saturday is 28.</p>`
