<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
