      text: `<p>Consider the following function.</p>
<p>int foo ( struct node * q )<br />{</p>
<p>if (q==null) return 0;</p>
<p>int c = q -&gt; data ;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if (q -&gt; link == NULL) return c;</p>
<p>else</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;c = c + foo (q = q -&gt; link) ;</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;return c ;</p>
<p>&nbsp; }</p>
<p>The above function run on the linked list that contain 4, 3 , 3, 7 ,8 . What will the content of the linked lists &amp; the return value?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 25,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&questionId=6ad2149e63f65db18429539c&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ad2149e63f65db18429539c&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F8b667da8-f205-45b6-9a12-ada9c075fe0c%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ad2149e63f65db18429539d&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:03:56)</a></p>
<p>The above program is adding the content of the linked list in recursive manner</p>
<p>Hence the final answer is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>`
