      text: `<p>Which of the following statements is/are TRUE?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>Binary tree is always connected.</p>`,
        `<p>Forest may be disconnected.</p>`,
        `<p>Skewed tree contains minimum number of nodes with height h.</p>`,
        `<p>Skewed tree contains maximum number of nodes with height h.</p>`,
      ],
      answer: ["A", "B", "C"],
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&questionId=6ad2149e63f65db1842953dd&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ad2149e63f65db1842953dd&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F68f285a3-5cd3-49c4-8115-83cf59f39114%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ad2149e63f65db1842953de&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:47)</a></p>
<p>A: A binary tree is always connected.<br />B: A forest may be disconnected.<br />C: A skewed tree contains the minimum number of nodes for height h.<br />D is false because a skewed tree contains the minimum, not maximum, number of nodes for a given height.</p>
<p>Hence A , B and C are correct option.</p>`
