      text: `<p>With a failure probability of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0.8</mn></math> per trial (<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></math> for success), what is the probability of exactly <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>3</mn></math> failure before the first success?</p>`,
