      text: `<p>How many candidate keys are present in a relation R(ABCXYZPQR) with the FD set</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mfenced open="{" close="}"><mrow><mi>ZR</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>CP</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>BQ</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Z</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>QR</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>AP</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>XYB</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Z</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>BC</mi><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>AR</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>?</mo></math></p>`,
