      video: "https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&questionId=6ad2149e63f65db184295491&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ad2149e63f65db184295491&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Ff3b00418-d44d-4006-bc79-75f2c0022eae%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ad2149e63f65db184295492&back_button=false",
      text: `<p>Consider the following program<br />int f1(int k) <br />{<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; if (k &lt;= 1)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; return 1;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; else<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; return (2 * f1(k - 1) + 3 * f1(k - 2));<br />}<br />What is the value of f1(6)?</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
        `<p>182</p>`,
        `<p>365</p>`,
        `<p>243</p>`,
        `<p>487</p>`,
      ],
      answer: "B",
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&questionId=6ad2149e63f65db184295491&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4fe6de5b979df2433b957&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6ad2149e63f65db184295491&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2Ff3b00418-d44d-4006-bc79-75f2c0022eae%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6ad2149e63f65db184295492&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:02:46)</a></p>
<p>f1(0)=f1(1)=1; f1(2)=5, f1(3)=13, f1(4)=41, f1(5)=121, f1(6)=2*121+3*41=365.</p>`
