      text: `<p style="text-align: justify;">A logical expression f(A, B, C) = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><menclose notation="top"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi></menclose></math>BC. Minimum no of 2 :1 MUX required to implement f(A,B,C) is P and min no. of 4 :1 MUX required to implement f(A,B,C) is Q. Then the value of (P + Q) is __________.</p>`,
      image: "",
      options: [
      ],
      answer: 3,
      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4ff30e5b979df2433b9ae&questionId=6adc905010d0e2cbf57215f8&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4ff30e5b979df2433b9ae&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6adc905010d0e2cbf57215f8&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F2b3ecb6b-4416-4ca4-88e6-03f0c8c42fd6%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6adc905010d0e2cbf57215f9&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:05:03)</a></p>
<p>Firstly we will implement is using 2 : 1 MUX.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><img title="0.png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/0c4bf790-feaa-4c37-8614-513f0cbf08b4.png" alt="" width="413" height="180" /></p>
<p>So, two 2 : 1 MUX is required i.e. P = 2</p>
<p>Now we will implement it using 4 : 1 MUX.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><img title="Screenshot 2025-10-29 154810.png" src="https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/QBG/7ebaf32d-0567-4404-9522-cff9cd44834d.png" alt="" width="292" height="211" /></p>
<p>So only one 4 : 1 MUX is required i.e. Q = 1</p>
<p>Therefore (P + Q) = 2 + 1 = 3</p>`
