      solution: `<p><a href="https://www.pw.live/watch/?type=penpencilvdo&mode=public-feeds&cameFrom=test-series&testId=69f4ff30e5b979df2433b9ae&questionId=6adc905010d0e2cbf57216a4&batchId=&testCategoryId=&parentId=6960b6755c7508c1bb165ed9&childId=69f4ff30e5b979df2433b9ae&vType=TEST_SERIES_QUESTION&secondaryChildId=6adc905010d0e2cbf57216a4&secondaryParentId=undefined&src=https%3A%2F%2Fd1d34p8vz63oiq.cloudfront.net%2F925cb965-b6e8-4f44-a5f0-daa5780653da%2Fmaster.mpd&is_comments_enabled=false&is_report_enabled=true&is_rating_enabled=true&is_products_enabled=false&is_header_enabled=true&typeKey=BATCH_QUIZ_VIDEO_SOLUTION&reportTypeKey=questionId&typeId=6adc905010d0e2cbf57216a5&back_button=false" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 16px;background:#5a4bda;color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">▶ Watch Video Solution (00:01:54)</a></p>
<p>Let degree-1 vertices be n.</p>
<p>Total number of vertices (V) = n+2+4+3 = n+9</p>
<p>Since the graph has the minimum number of edges, it is a tree.</p>
<p><span data-d-streaming-word="">For</span> <span data-d-streaming-word="">a</span> <span data-d-streaming-word="">tree,</span></p>
<p><span data-d-streaming-word=""><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>deg</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">V</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></span></p>
<p><span data-d-streaming-word="">Using the given degrees:</span></p>
<p><span data-d-streaming-word=""><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak="newline"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak="newline"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn><mspace linebreak="newline"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></span></p>`
